[size=5][b]Fear & Hunger Co-op: Termina and Fear & Hunger 1 (2-4 players)[/b][/size]

Play [b]Fear & Hunger 2: Termina[/b] or [b]Fear & Hunger 1[/b] together with your friends - up to 4 players. Every player controls their own character: walks around, talks to people, opens their own menu and takes their own turns in battle.

[size=4][b]How you can play[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]On one PC[/b] - keyboard and gamepads. The screen splits when you walk apart (or one shared camera - your choice).
[*][b]Online[/b] (experimental) - every player on their own PC with their own copy of the game, over the local network or the internet (Radmin VPN / ZeroTier, or a forwarded port).
[/list]

[size=4][b]Features[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Join any time[/b] - press a button on the map and pick a character from the party. Online, a guest can also bring the main character of their own save (level, skills, equipment).
[*][b]Battles together or apart[/b] - fight the same enemy together, or each one their own battle at the same time. Walk up to a friend's battle and join in.
[*][b]Your own light and stamina[/b] - every player carries their own torch and has their own running stamina.
[*][b]Death and soul stones[/b] - a fallen player leaves a body; bring them back with a soul stone. A dead player watches the others' battles.
[*][b]The protagonist can change[/b] - if the protagonist dies, the next player takes over and the story goes on.
[*][b]PvP[/b] - attack another player: the game's own body-part battles, cut arms, legs and heads, fights to the death, several sides at once. Kill the protagonist - become the protagonist.
[*][b]Lots of settings and cheats[/b] - rules for death, revives, PvP, camera, and test cheats.
[*][b]English and Russian[/b] - the mod's texts in both languages.
[/list]

[size=4][b]New in Termina (spoilers)[/b][/size]
[spoiler]
[list]
[*][b]The tower door with several players:[/b] "Only one may leave". Each player chooses what to say - to fight or to end it. If everybody chooses to end it: a new ending, [b]The Fourth Festival[/b].
[*][b]Sulfur idols:[/b] save the other contestants by defeating their moonscorched forms at their sulfur idols - before they turn. Plan your route: some turn already on day 1.
[*][b]The top of the tower together:[/b] with every contestant saved or dead, everybody climbs the tower. Per'kele makes all of you an offer - each player decides: join the Sulfur God or kill him. A new ending, [b]The Broken Circle[/b]: the train with everyone who survived, and the ending of every player's character.
[/list]
[/spoiler]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Unpack the archive into the game folder (where [b]Game.exe[/b] is) and agree to replace the files. The archive's [b]www[/b] folder goes on top of the game's [b]www[/b] folder.
[*]Start the game. On the map press [b]X[/b] (or [b]Start[/b] on a gamepad) - player 2 joins. [b]U[/b] / [b]Numpad 0[/b] or [b]Start[/b] on another gamepad - the next one.
[*]Online: Options > Co-op > Network game (see [i]docs/NETPLAY.md[/i] in the archive).
[/list]
[b]Update:[/b] unpack the new version the same way.
[b]Remove:[/b] delete LookOutsideOnline.js, LocalCoop_FearHunger.js and LocalCoop_Net.js from [i]www/js/plugins[/i]. To restore the game's own main.js too: Steam > Verify integrity of game files.

The game's [i]plugins.js[/i] is not changed: the mod's [i]www/js/main.js[/i] is the game's own one plus a few lines that load the co-op plugins.

[size=4][b]Requirements and notes[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Fear & Hunger 2: Termina or Fear & Hunger 1 (Steam versions tested).
[*]Online, everybody needs the same version of the mod.
[*]It's a big mod for games made for one player - bugs happen. Please report them on Discord or GitHub.
[/list]

